  "implementation": {
    "laboratory": "One bounded decoration layer for unchanged vial/screen poses at their existing 100/120ms ticks; backing scale follows the real camera. Static PC props reuse the same layer. Rebuild on device snapshot/scale/map change. Release on hidden tab, covered battle, loading and destruction. Shared original painting functions.",
    "tournament": "Prepare immutable sky/water masks and water row bounds once. Refraction draws only the nonempty water bands using exactly the original displacement; reuse mask pixel data during cloud extraction instead of repeated readbacks. Shared lobby/SAS/duel implementation.",
    "battleHouse": "Reuse the fixed window Path2D; omit only flakes completely outside the camera, with a two-unit safety margin. Same trajectories, number and cadence of visible flakes.",
    "discarded": "A cached snow bitmap increased native rendering cost and was discarded before release."
  },
